{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "6dc62932ca067750eaa11f4d31456c778ec956173b5d67cdf70bc3577651da88", "ja": "延長戦突入！", "zh": "进入加时赛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "77bb7aa9638801fae9dfd099f9411d39e34fd4b49384d003cb5b6725f851a916", "ja": "CD販売対決イベントは、いよいよ延長戦に\n突入！真剣勝負を見守るプロデューサー。\n途中、奈緒の兄達や、昴の兄の友人による\n裏切り（？）もありつつ、4人は最後まで\n全力で競い合うのだった。", "zh": "CD贩售对决活动终于进入了加时赛！\n制作人注视着这场认真的较量。\n中途虽然出现了奈绪的哥哥们以及昴的\n哥哥的朋友的“背叛（？）”，但4人还是\n全力竞争到了最后。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "93bb7582eb3bc899b042cc47801fe2120de690f1353ea9aed594f4d236003c12", "ja": "（CD販売イベントは、延長戦に突入！　心なしか、\n集まったお客さん達からも熱気を感じる……）", "zh": "（CD销售活动进入了加时赛！不知是不是错觉，连聚集而来的客人们似乎也散发着一股热烈的气氛……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8d747f7e30febbcb6bd5ece4c5d9717f0051a33da653c29a54eb1e1473535bc4", "ja": "（もう、こちらが手を出せることはない。\n後はみんなの真剣勝負を見守るのみだ！）", "zh": "（已经没什么是我们能做的了。接下来只要守望大家的认真对决！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "612ec9509fdc6bb9cf30cba81122d6f571c548076e95aac91b53389b965efac7", "ja": "さあさあ！　いよいよ最終日、延長戦ですよ！\n今ならもれなくオマケ付きやで♪", "zh": "来来！终于到了最后一天，进入加时赛啦！现在一律附赠小礼物哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "5858e1c1b635b740d9be69c0c3ef15ead83f3fb9062cb18b417a63168f9e5d68", "ja": "カードにコイン、鳩にハンカチ。\nお好きな手品をご覧に入れましょう。", "zh": "卡牌、硬币、手帕和鸽子。\n请欣赏您喜欢的魔术吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b1784b94246524fa87c2aae73e7cade1d46af6b0ad78706965ee9050f49151cd", "ja": "さ、サイン付きCD、\nたくさんご用意してまーす！", "zh": "签、签名CD，  \n我准备了好多张哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "dc2008c972a3d165e3baedbcef7d2b9664370513317ea6a64220be63781881a7", "ja": "オレはサインボールつき！\nみんな、よろしく頼むぜ！", "zh": "我这边是附赠签名球的！大家，拜托啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1006_kei", "source_sha256": "20058b5a7f574687cd2bb72bd80aa683b44ad415cf0df424f9c660d27bd79a5c", "ja": "お～、みんな気合い入っとるなぁ。", "zh": "哦～大家都干劲十足嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "62bde121b40c3e5dd718afd1fd284a82c1683d96778ccf4f7492e57e2f7fe029", "ja": "うわ、アニキ！？\nあっ、またみんな連れてきてくれてるやん！", "zh": "哇，老哥！？\n啊，你又把大家都带来了呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1008_kei", "source_sha256": "7c3a91404fb7cf8c94c2c04f035287d5a1997e0de57d2d05c02258b4b4fae7e3", "ja": "ああ。\nこの間の話したら、みんなも来たい言うから。", "zh": "啊。\n我一提起上次的事，大家也都说想来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "cf59d1f97afca6fbb3802de8ad86b83bd7be69999c922aa588d3aa9218d78294", "ja": "そうなんや、ありがとう♪　も～、アニキも\nなんやかんや言うて最後は妹の応援に……あれ？", "zh": "原来是这样，谢谢♪　真是的，哥哥嘴上说着这样那样，最后还是来给妹妹加油……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1010_kei", "source_sha256": "5de8d30cdcca893c6f8e10efcdd6b2ea8cd9c84f9accc2d6272c6bf698d37edf", "ja": "瑞希ちゃん、1枚ください。", "zh": "瑞希，给我1张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "e0a1c8de7964fcd27e155d31d1f95c197cd8a75e85c5e22ef533b96df7e08397", "ja": "えっ。\n……わ、私ですか？", "zh": "诶。\n……我、我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "2c4f78bdb3341fa3ca4331f8be98510b882e672bd1025d3fe30f75a7305c5c9a", "ja": "なっ……アニキ！？\nなんで瑞希の方で買うてるん！？", "zh": "什……大哥！？\n为什么你要在瑞希那边买啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1013_kei", "source_sha256": "e9458b2d60bd1cf21b4f1e8f83b59c383ef5edc11f9aafe52e7579f8ac07e8cf", "ja": "なんでって……瑞希ちゃん、前にうちの\nクラブチームのイベントで、ライブやってくれたやろ。", "zh": "为什么嘛……瑞希，你之前不是在我们俱乐部队的活动上帮忙表演过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1014_kei", "source_sha256": "2e73ab83426523c482dce93d1b08757c5190a95fe003dcf79ff08e29db5d0351", "ja": "そん時も、盛り上がってな。\nチームメイトが、その時のお礼をしたいって。", "zh": "到时候也要热闹起来啊。\n队友说，想为那时的事向你道谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1015_timumeitoc", "source_sha256": "2724015ff85b1ff05d726b020aebd98016476695c19b471312a8a0f9fcae97ca", "ja": "あの時は『Raise the FLAG』を\n歌ってくれましたよね！", "zh": "那时您演唱了\n《Raise the FLAG》对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1016_timumeitod", "source_sha256": "be20916897d52da6997d310eb5d4abf036ec92b722246461f3faf2c045db6b36", "ja": "あの歌めっちゃ熱くて最高でした！\n今日は俺達が、瑞希ちゃんを応援したくて。", "zh": "那首歌特别燃，太棒了！\n今天，我们就是想给瑞希加油。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "0093ccb7448cba254ef6969dc1e63279c7a9c172318cf902415bb6164d4a3749", "ja": "あ……ありがとうございます。\n新曲も熱いので、ぜひ。", "zh": "啊……谢谢你。\n新歌也很燃，请一定要听。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1018_kei", "source_sha256": "4146abfab6dcc7fd4095532880c116422de34cf8ef432ff4661648bcef0253e7", "ja": "誰が言うたか知らんけど、延長日できてよかったわ。\nこういう時に助けないでどうするんだって、な？", "zh": "不知道是谁提的，不过能有延长日真是太好了。\n这种时候不伸出援手，那还等什么，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "35246668c517139a44db0b03d89494a3328fdb441fa8d89bdfa2ab2863cb2141", "ja": "くぅ……！　せやからって、\nそんな大勢引き連れて来んでも……！", "zh": "呜……！话虽如此，也不用带这么多人过来吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1020_kei", "source_sha256": "29f126d905d9c27c3e775a4568bd3ab2dddf9b25235a503cd650972e1bf91551", "ja": "タイミングやからしゃあない。", "zh": "时机问题，没办法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1021_kei", "source_sha256": "e3bf53aef17fdb124d89c5c6928a34bfd4068d55017406d5fc20531628e1fc43", "ja": "言うたやろ？\n勝負に、完全なフェアなんて存在しないって。", "zh": "我不是说过吗？胜负之中，根本不存在绝对的公平。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1022_037nao", "source_sha256": "6c314947b7b1cce9fdf9dbc1749be3ab006d5807bf7e1d08fee047952de3e456", "ja": "もうやったわそれ！　私からみんなに言うたし！\n{$P$}さんが纏めてくれたわ！", "zh": "那早就做过了！我跟大家都说过了！\n还是{$P$}先生帮我总结的呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1023_kei", "source_sha256": "3832bad1de1304016602f90b2379ae2743530911e86d7c77a80eb530ae893c4f", "ja": "あ、そうなん？\nわかっとるなら、ええねんけど。", "zh": "啊，是这样吗？\n你明白了就行，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1024_037nao", "source_sha256": "fce80bac87591e1a6825582280f3805e5ab132baeab62bf40e2266ef78df1c93", "ja": "ぐぬぬ……うっさいわボケ！\nあっちいけ、バカアニキ！", "zh": "唔唔……吵死了，你这笨蛋！\n走开啦，笨哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1025_kei", "source_sha256": "ca1a87876b0437784d2339ebdca2ec35525c29510e538e2d1502a409ff5795aa", "ja": "お～、こわ。\n自分も気張りや～。", "zh": "哦～好可怕。\n\n我也得加把劲啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1026_037nao", "source_sha256": "e39c944fd4ba7b14272eadd9e6087571e0cc79db511f3d930f9c6f06ca98828d", "ja": "まさかここに来て、身内が最大の敵やなんて！\n腹立つわ～……！", "zh": "没想到到头来，自己人竟然成了最大的敌人！\n真让人生气啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1027_047sub", "source_sha256": "ba07efda58d5438ab625143ac37e363ee1b0ba7875b640d4d9431a84db24bc35", "ja": "うわっ、瑞希のところすげー並んでる！\n最後の大逆転、マジでありそうだな……。", "zh": "哇，瑞希那边排了好多人！\n说不定真的要上演最后的大逆转了啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1028_hiroto", "source_sha256": "cfb1ebd6c46cbb4873bf121e2c342af2513f5e84cd6fedbf4357b98a62665895", "ja": "えっ！？　横山選手じゃん！\nマサ兄の言ってたこと、本当だったんだ。", "zh": "诶！？这不是横山选手吗！\n阿政哥说的是真的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1029_souta", "source_sha256": "4cdad917ab52e88b56d8c5ab49b2d971419beda87ef37cfaf21d4fe3e5955ce9", "ja": "ていうか、チームメンバーみんないない？\nうわ～、サインもらえないかな～……。", "zh": "话说，队员们是不是都不在？\n哇～不知道能不能拿到签名啊～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1030_047sub", "source_sha256": "6b35f05daf940f3c227188d89c7fcac08d4f489485d47f0b697522431e749be2", "ja": "祐翔（ひろと）兄ちゃん、颯太（そうた）兄ちゃん！\nもう、兄ちゃんたちはこっちだろ～！？", "zh": "祐翔哥、颯太哥！\n你们应该在这边吧——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1031_047sub", "source_sha256": "a2cae093e30b928584aaca5f80ac4b2dc23b9e3dc6a7294eb2c75e2756094ed0", "ja": "確かにプロサッカー選手はすごいけど、\n誰の応援に来たのか忘れないでくれよな！", "zh": "职业足球运动员确实很厉害，\n但别忘了你们是来给谁加油的啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1032_souta", "source_sha256": "6d4c7767a36975ec8e401bd1892510b7e32946c0c2072c176777ca69232fe976", "ja": "悪い。横山選手、野球一家のうちでも\n知ってるくらいだからさ……。", "zh": "不好意思。横山选手可是连我们这个棒球世家都知道的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1033_hiroto", "source_sha256": "ca7e0b1dd6b2ad4cba44da449e1c303d017f73d696ed695d86dfb5534f8a9912", "ja": "心配しなくても大丈夫だぞ、昴！　大学の友達\n連れてきたし、ちゃんと昴の応援……あれ？", "zh": "不用担心，没事的，昴！我把大学朋友\n带过来了，会好好给昴加油……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1034_yutonoyuujin", "source_sha256": "78efcb530d1a636631b70811261dc21a04f9d25d9a5abaeb90d24cf9e41b1999", "ja": "……あ、あのっ！\nオレっ、実は雪歩さんの大ファンで……っ！", "zh": "……啊、那个！\n我、我其实是雪步小姐的忠实粉丝……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1035_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7290f2d3298b88eed2e87d42b6126bbcb88cb87c4fba2f30c94d23b09c4328b1", "ja": "！　お、男の人……だけど……。", "zh": "！男、男的……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1036_yutonoyuujin", "source_sha256": "153c5325a91f1a999274e0ed854835dd1d2c1300dc91752fb6abd0b8278a2ece", "ja": "雪歩さんが出るライブは、ほとんど参加してて！\nサイン付きCD買えるなんて、夢みたいで……っ！", "zh": "雪步小姐参加的演唱会，我几乎场场都去了！居然能买到签名CD，简直像做梦一样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1037_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2ef29fd8ba712c5ae692d6fce7fc80d2a44b5d25228dca3b4c4aa12319b1acda", "ja": "き、緊張してるんですか……？　あ、あの、\n落ち着いて……深呼吸、してくださいね……？", "zh": "你、你很紧张吗……？那、那个，冷静一下……请深呼吸……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1038_yutonoyuujin", "source_sha256": "0795e0749b17a98916dbca6543ad84ad1bdd789baae04775fe86108757db77bf", "ja": "は、はい！\n……すう、はあ……。", "zh": "是、是！\n……吸气，呼气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1039_004yuk", "source_sha256": "df4424d7f0ca336e31a687ae596277a2aaa3200ed1478da18d43ee5e91358b04", "ja": "えっと、昴ちゃんのお兄さんの、お友達なんですよね？\nなんだか、不思議な感じ……ふふ。", "zh": "那个，您是昴的哥哥的朋友，对吧？\n总觉得有点不可思议……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1040_047sub", "source_sha256": "ecdd6e7655c00bdb218b831f203616c1cf83d8abd6bf936fcfc6e05724ddf416", "ja": "友達、雪歩のファンの人じゃんか！\n祐翔兄ちゃんのバカ～……！", "zh": "明明就是雪步的粉丝嘛！\n祐翔哥哥这个笨蛋～……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1041_hiroto", "source_sha256": "6aca245fa4674bbca623c5a72a7739e37da57b0e72c3b87140b553f4f5db6c3c", "ja": "だ、大丈夫！　もう一回買わせる！　\n今度は昴の方で！", "zh": "没、没关系！我会让你再买一次！\n这次买昴的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1042_souta", "source_sha256": "8851fe4fcbc1bbe69a626ca639b0e719fa652b1a9eab45047f2987fa614699be", "ja": "工場の人たちに配る分もちゃんと買う！\nマサ兄から言われてるから！", "zh": "也要好好买齐分给工厂大家的那份！\n因为政哥交代过我了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1043_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1044_044miz", "source_sha256": "e84c4b952fd0e0d2ff9d5536624eb61edcc441e8bb2e10f5cca580c2661a6d53", "ja": "残りあと1時間……\nだいぶ、混沌としてきました。", "zh": "还剩1小时……\n已经变得相当混乱了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1045_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e8748ccf2f5a2132887a87dd6a3f72da56ac65fc6bc01a5f51fb89ca03f4cd08", "ja": "大勢の人が、来てくれてますね。\nあとは私たちが、いかに注目を集められるか……。", "zh": "好多人都过来了呢。\n接下来就看我们能吸引到多少关注了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1046_047sub", "source_sha256": "42ff0a62624e5e5bf5a7766417ac4fddc1d3d1a8c18f3b65c7ecf67bdefbda87", "ja": "番狂わせ、ってやつだな！\n面白くなってきたぜ！", "zh": "这就是所谓的爆冷逆袭吧！\n事情变得有意思起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1047_037nao", "source_sha256": "97f4968f1d9beb64983435909b966eb283d78e5eb8ae415325b4b40e0ed8fd37", "ja": "こっからが本当の勝負やで、瑞希！", "zh": "从现在开始才是真正的较量，瑞希！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_06_1048_044miz", "source_sha256": "0c9856cbfc542faed3ff4b70f92f3887393243e5e61b763eac0ebd87cdf6eaa6", "ja": "はい。負けません……！", "zh": "好的。我不会输的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
